	(text "RK3588 unit 1: PCIe3 PHY (4 lanes, split 4 x 1) and the three combo PHYs.\nLane to slot mapping is in PCIE3_LANES in build.py and is still to be confirmed\nagainst Rockchip's PCIe guide. Combo PHY 1 is spare (usable for SATA only).\nRESREF resistors are 200R 1%, as on the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic (sheet 18).\nSupply pins go to rails named after the PHY; filtering and decoupling belong on the power sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "602cc19d-e0d6-5d12-b8da-5cb5548b00f0")
	)
